  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper compares CVaR-VQE peptide folding against molecular dynamics on 50 seven-amino-acid peptides. It reports 9 qubits, 500000 shots per iteration, 100 iterations per peptide, VQE mean energy of -5.885 kcal/mol versus MD mean energy of 2.302 kcal/mol, and 98% of peptides reaching ground-state energy below 0 kcal/mol under VQE versus 72% for MD. The work is simulator-based and does not demonstrate practical quantum advantage.",
