        "ansatz": "parameterized quantum circuit with Hadamard, conditional rotational gates, and CNOT gates; two levels of RX, RY, and RZ rotations over configuration and interaction qubits",
        "optimizer": "surrogateopt (Global Optimization Toolbox); genetic method referenced from prior work",
        "num_layers": 2,
